      "items": [
        "Sources resolve relative to config.conf beside the installer. Environment variables and ~ expand in paths; blank lines and comments are ignored.",
        "A /* mapping must end with /* on both sides. Each direct child becomes one pair, sorted by name; wildcard source directories must exist.",
        "Ordinary tool names come from the first source directory. For agents/ sources, the receiving home-directory tool determines selection (install:58–70)."
      ]
