      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Examples and iteration behavior",
      "items": [
        "config.conf:5 maps ./nvim to $HOME/.config/nvim. config.conf:27–28 maps shared instructions and each shared skill to DSH.",
        "./install --install dsh selects the DSH destinations, including shared assets. Omit tool names to process all configured mappings.",
        "Each successful or skipped pair continues the same loop. Notes are printed after the loop, including an all-skipped batch. Existing targets are never replaced during installation."
